WEBVTT

00:08:28.963 --> 00:08:33.384
worse health outcomes
and lower civic participation

00:08:33.384 --> 00:08:36.637
than in states without such
laws on the books.

00:08:39.348 --> 00:08:42.643
But it's not just employers
and politicians

00:08:42.685 --> 00:08:44.562
that are holding unions back.

00:08:44.895 --> 00:08:48.691
Unions are a cause
of some of their own problems.

00:08:49.692 --> 00:08:53.279
Some unions are extremely bureaucratic,

00:08:53.279 --> 00:08:56.532
stifling debate and innovation.

00:08:57.616 --> 00:08:59.910
Some union leaders are corrupt.